<td class="gd_combo_spacer" width="4"></td>
<td class="gd_combo_text_cell">
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Maude Hill</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Since 1990, Maude Hill has played a leading role in Homeport’s organizational journey that has lifted the lives of thousands of Central Ohio residents through affordable housing, financial education and access to supporting services. She’s worked with residents to learn their needs and assisted in the design and floor plans of family-friendly apartment homes.</p>
</td>
  </tr>
